                "reservations"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Protected. Consumes Program capacity using the Invoice's own stored FX conversion (no new FX call happens here). Fails 409 if this would oversubscribe available capacity, or if the Invoice already has an active Reservation. Fails 404 if the Program or Invoice does not exist.",
